      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The authors have analyzed the efficiency of a complex treatment containing vertical underwater traction (VUT) method for patients with lumbosacral pain syndromes. The use of VUT in a complex treatment of patients with lumbosacral pain syndromes was determined to be effective by clinical data and positive indices of electroneuromyography."},
